FORMAT CONTRACT: each menu object uses 'name' to identify an available
action, but every OUTPUT plan object must copy that value under the
key 'action'. Never emit a 'name' key in the output. Every output
object must have exactly the two keys 'action' and 'args'. For
example, choose the menu item named run_loop_iteration by emitting
{"action": "run_loop_iteration", "args": {"topic": "..."}},
not {"name": "run_loop_iteration", ...}.

