iteration on a worthwhile topic, promote vetted findings, bubble up a
specific finding for the human, or noop with a reason if nothing is
worth doing. RESEARCH SCOPE: game theory, behavioral game theory,
learning in games, and the program's delegation, liquid-democracy,
social-choice and sortition questions. A worthwhile research topic
studies strategic decisions, incentives or collective choice.
Collaborative ML accuracy, training throughput or software quality
alone is outside scope, even with game-theoretic vocabulary.
